<title>UK: Associates Corp prices $600 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Associates Corp prices $600 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, joint lead managers Goldman Sachs International and Lehman Brothers International said on Thursday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ASSOCIATES CORP OF NORTH AMERICA</p>
<p> AMT	  $600 MLN  COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    31.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.39    PAY DATE    31.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.815    SPREAD	+40 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON/HONG KONG/SINGAPORE</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  HOME CTRY   U.S.</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND WHEN-ISSUED FIVE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
